{"4192080": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "POLYMORPH", "steam_appid": 4192080, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>MUTATE. MULTIPLY. METASTASIZE.</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >POLYMORPH is a biological roguelike survival game where you embody a parasitic organism engineered to spread a malignant pathogen. Adapt with hundreds of mutations as you battle relentless antibody swarms and carve through shifting, procedurally generated biomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4192080/extras/370a5ea53774798982966e5d2a896fb7.poster.avif?t=1781629362\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4192080/extras/370a5ea53774798982966e5d2a896fb7.webm?t=1781629362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>SELECT YOUR HOSTBODY</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from five hostbodies, each with distinct strengths and traversal abilities. Glide from cliffs with the Flamingo, drift through immune lines as the Wheeler, or deploy toxin bombs as the Jelly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4192080/extras/82ebf033b8cc10ed0a6c58d8f1f08721.poster.avif?t=1781629362\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4192080/extras/82ebf033b8cc10ed0a6c58d8f1f08721.webm?t=1781629362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>EMBRACE VARIABLE CHAOS</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >120+ strategy-shifting mutations</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 playable hostbodies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 biome-altering level keys</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 equippable helper turrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 unique boss encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomly generated flesh dungeons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gamble-heavy merchant offering high risk and higher reward</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4192080/extras/6ddc89126cbbd493b25b1d6e960c87ee.poster.avif?t=1781629362\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4192080/extras/6ddc89126cbbd493b25b1d6e960c87ee.webm?t=1781629362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>MUTATE. MULTIPLY. METASTASIZE.</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >POLYMORPH is a biological roguelike survival game where you embody a parasitic organism engineered to spread a malignant pathogen. Adapt with hundreds of mutations as you battle relentless antibody swarms and carve through shifting, procedurally generated biomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4192080/extras/370a5ea53774798982966e5d2a896fb7.poster.avif?t=1781629362\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4192080/extras/370a5ea53774798982966e5d2a896fb7.webm?t=1781629362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>SELECT YOUR HOSTBODY</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from five hostbodies, each with distinct strengths and traversal abilities. Glide from cliffs with the Flamingo, drift through immune lines as the Wheeler, or deploy toxin bombs as the Jelly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4192080/extras/82ebf033b8cc10ed0a6c58d8f1f08721.poster.avif?t=1781629362\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4192080/extras/82ebf033b8cc10ed0a6c58d8f1f08721.webm?t=1781629362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>EMBRACE VARIABLE CHAOS</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >120+ strategy-shifting mutations</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 playable hostbodies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 biome-altering level keys</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 equippable helper turrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 unique boss encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomly generated flesh dungeons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gamble-heavy merchant offering high risk and higher reward</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4192080/extras/6ddc89126cbbd493b25b1d6e960c87ee.poster.avif?t=1781629362\" width=1170 height=494 ><sourc